1
00:00:07,257 --> 00:00:08,427
[GROANS]

2
00:00:09,592 --> 00:00:11,222
[SIGHS]

3
00:00:11,803 --> 00:00:12,973
- Good morning, Leonard.
- Aah!

4
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:16,597
- Uh-huh.
- We have to stop by Pottery Barn...

5
00:00:16,766 --> 00:00:20,106
(Sheldon:)...on the way to work.
I bought these Star Wars sheets.

6
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:24,900
(Sheldon:)They turned out to be much too stimulating
to be compatible with a good night's sleep.

7
00:00:26,651 --> 00:00:29,321
(Sheldon:)I don't like the way
Darth Vader stares at me.

8
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,030
(Leonard:)I'm not going to work.

9
00:00:32,198 --> 00:00:36,658
(Sheldon:)Just because your career's been stagnant
for a few years, that's no reason to give up.

10
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:40,460
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I was up all night
using the new free-electron laser...

11
00:00:40,623 --> 00:00:42,713
...for my x-ray-diffraction experiment.

12
00:00:42,876 --> 00:00:45,716
(Sheldon:)Did the laser accidentally
burn out your retinas?

13
00:00:46,129 --> 00:00:48,629
(Leonard:)- No.
- Then you can drive. Let's go.

14
00:00:48,798 --> 00:00:50,178
[LEONARD SIGHS]

15
00:00:51,051 --> 00:00:55,181
(Leonard:)Didn't I tell you I'd be working nights and
you'd have to make other arrangements?

16
00:00:55,346 --> 00:00:56,596
- You did.
- And?

17
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:58,555
(Sheldon:)I didn't.

18
00:00:59,476 --> 00:01:01,026
(Sheldon:)Let's go.

